## 14. Limitations of Artificial Intelligence

Although AI is powerful, it has important limitations.

### 14.1 Lack of Guaranteed Accuracy

AI systems can generate incorrect results even when the output appears convincing.

### 14.2 Data Dependency

The performance of machine-learning models depends heavily on the quality and relevance of their training data.

### 14.3 Bias

If training data contains unfair patterns, the model may reproduce those patterns.

### 14.4 Limited Context

Some AI systems cannot access information that has not been provided to them or retrieved through connected tools.

### 14.5 Lack of Human Judgment

AI does not automatically possess human values, experience or common-sense judgment.

### 14.6 Security and Privacy

AI systems may expose sensitive information if they are not properly designed and secured.

